title: 'pallet-revive: add `burn` to the System precompile'
doc:
- audience: Runtime User
  description: |-
    The System precompile gains `burn(uint256 amount)`. It removes `amount`, in the unit of
    `msg.value`, from the spendable balance of the caller and from the total issuance. The caller
    is the account that calls the precompile: a contract burns its own funds, and so does an
    account that calls the precompile directly. Held and frozen funds and the existential deposit
    are not spendable. When `amount` has a dust part the caller does not hold, one more spendable
    unit is converted into dust first.

    The call reverts when:
    - the spendable balance of the caller is lower than `amount`
    - `amount` does not fit the balance type of the chain
    - value is sent along with the call
    - the precompile is reached through a delegate call

    In a static context it fails without revert data. A call dispatched by root fails with
    `RootNotAllowed`.

    The whole units of `amount` are reported as `Balances::Burned`. A dust conversion emits its
    own `Burned` of one unit first, so the `Burned` amounts of one call add up to the whole units
    of `amount` plus one. The dust part emits no event, and no EVM log is emitted.
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Contracts can now reduce the total issuance. `System.burn` bypasses `Config::OnBurn`, which
    keeps receiving the gas rounding only, and a runtime cannot disable the function. No
    migration is needed.

    `pallet_revive::WeightInfo` gains the required method `burn(d: u32)`, where `d` is 1 when
    `amount` has a dust part. Runtimes using `SubstrateWeight` or `()` need no change. Runtimes
    with their own implementation have to add the method and should regenerate their weights
    with the new `burn` benchmark.

    `ISystemCalls` in `pallet-revive-uapi` gains a `burn` variant. Code that matches on it
    exhaustively has to add an arm.
crates:
- name: pallet-revive
  bump: major
- name: pallet-revive-uapi
  bump: major
- name: pallet-revive-fixtures
  bump: minor
- name: asset-hub-westend-runtime
  bump: patch
